Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:02.50,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't attract too much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:05.12,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:08.15,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:11.07,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Prince Renato and I were engaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:35.51,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFEFD&\an8\fs40\c&H1B1A20&\shad0\bord4\fad(1782,1)}Always a {\c&H8971F4&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:14.99,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,so I returned to my home \Nin the Kingdom of Muro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.36,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(20,320,330,320)\c&H303637&\3c&HECF6F5&\fs8\frz-4.09\shad0}Knight Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:50.01,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:50.01,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}How the {\c&H8A74F6&}One {\c&H080600&}That Got Away {\c&HD29E5C&}Visited Home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:02:01.20,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,It takes three days to travel from \Nthe royal capital in Rubini to Muro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:07.46,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,First, I'd take the Ametis family \Ncarriage to a town near the border,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:12.34,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,where I'd transfer to a carriage \Nsent by the Annovazzis to pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.35,0:02:21.31,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This place looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:27.13,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,L-Lady Maria, please don't \Nwander around too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:31.96,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Besides, we've \Ngot time until my ride arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:36.93,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:44.69,main,SHOPKEEPER 1,0,0,0,,These were just picked \Nthis morning. Try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.09,0:02:50.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,They're delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:54.50,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I wish Prince Renato could try these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:03:01.30,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,He eats fine meals every day, but \NI doubt he gets much freshly-picked fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.58,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:13.31,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,That can wait until after \Nwe're married... I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:16.39,main,SHOPKEEPER 2,0,0,0,,Care for some grapes, milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:18.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Grapes? Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:25.10,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Th-The sweetness and sourness \Nare perfectly balanced,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:28.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,and a rich aftertaste \Nspreads throughout my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.84,main,SHOPKEEPER 2,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:34.11,main,SHOPKEEPER 2,0,0,0,,For a limited time, I'm selling \Nall you can fit in one basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Sold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.45,main,GOFFREDO & MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:48.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You can instantly tell \Nthey were sent by my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:55.31,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Goffredo, Macchio!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:57.98,main,GOFFREDO & MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.86,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again. \NYou seem well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.35,main,GOFFREDO & MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.29,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Hey, crown princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:12.86,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,We're relieved you \Nhaven't changed, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:16.30,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Seriously? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:18.57,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We're still only engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.32,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\shad0\move(475,155,480,135)\frz-24.66\fad(1,1061)}FREEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.15,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.67,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Crown princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:25.04,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.80,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,The whole house was in a panic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:30.12,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,after receiving that letter \Nfrom the King of Rubini!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.30,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Was Dad angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.16,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:39.22,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,We've never seen him make \Nthat face before either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.79,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:43.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What about my sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:47.65,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Even your married sisters have \Nreturned and are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:49.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:53.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I won't have any peace. I'm not \Nsure I want to go home anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:54.46,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:57.57,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You must explain what happened yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.95,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Oh. Little Lord Teodorico said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:04.71,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,"I can't wait to see my sister again."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:07.70,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:11.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:22.57,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted from the long \Njourney, but we'll only stop for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.83,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,We'd like to cross the border \Nsooner rather than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:31.01,main,CUSTOMER 1,0,0,0,,Is that a noble lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:33.35,main,CUSTOMER 2,0,0,0,,What's she doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.36,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Have you gotten used to life in Rubini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:38.87,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Yes. It's so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:41.07,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Everyone's so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.92,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.75,main,INNKEEPER,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:46.10,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:51.58,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:55.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:58.75,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because we're near Muro, \Nbut this food tastes like back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:03.13,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Do Muro and Rubini dishes taste different?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:06.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Well, they're similar,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:10.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,but Rubini dishes aren't \Nas strongly flavored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:17.14,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Are you all right eating that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:20.65,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,You become a bottomless pit \Nwhen you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:23.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hey, that's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:29.24,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:33.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Really? I think I've gotten \Na bit more ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:36.04,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:37.19,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:55.31,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Recently, the mountain road \Nto the Kingdom of Muro
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:58.15,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,has become dangerous \Ndue to bandit attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:01.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That must be around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:05.78,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Nothing happened when I came \Nthrough here six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:12.09,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Either way, it's only been six months, \Nbut it feels so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:15.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I guess I've been dealing with a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:22.84,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,My grapes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:25.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:27.93,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Forgive me, milady. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:34.94,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,If you want to pass, \Nyou'll have to beat us first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:38.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:42.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's going on? Are they the bandits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:46.08,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,I'll convince them to let us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.85,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Please wait inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:52.20,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,They don't look like bandits. \NTry to settle this peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:56.85,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,That will depend on how they respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:03.92,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,What seems to be the problem? \NWho are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:13.40,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Forgive us, milord! Please arrest us \Nand take us to the royal castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.11,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:15.60,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.44,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:19.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:22.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:27.83,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Ah, a noble lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.07,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,She must be a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:33.46,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,She's a lady fer shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:35.83,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Please, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:39.83,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,They're all armed with \Nwell-maintained farming tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.87,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,They must use these for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:44.75,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I don't sense any bloodlust either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:48.48,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,They don't seem to be trying to trick us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:53.38,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We'll at least hear you \Nout. Raise your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:56.90,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,What a kind lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.99,main,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,This might actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:01.73,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,We're real lucky fer shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:05.61,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,One of you has quite the heavy accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:09.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I don't know why you're doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:13.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,but you should choose your \Nvictims more carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:16.99,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You shouldn't attack carriages \Ndriven by such muscular men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:20.99,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We're terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:26.42,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,But the chief's daughter's gone missing \Nfrom our village of Navarro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:35.40,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Yes. She suddenly \Ndisappeared a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:41.27,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We've visited the local lord's mansion \Nseveral times, but he's ignoring us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Who's the lord of this area?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.57,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Count Nardi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:50.19,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I've never met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:55.87,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,The guards and knights \Nwon't investigate without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:09:59.07,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz28.3\fs15\pos(234,239)}STOMP
