Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:02.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What kind of terrible lord ignores \Nhis people when they're in need?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:05.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.86,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Please don't, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:13.34,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You'd only be causing trouble for Prince \NRenato by going to visit the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:11.13,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz-19.03\fs15\pos(460,232)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:11.47,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz28.3\fs15\pos(266,194)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:11.80,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz28.3\fs15\pos(234,239)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:11.97,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz-19.03\fs15\pos(438,191)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:12.13,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz-19.03\fs15\pos(460,232)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:12.30,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz28.3\fs15\pos(266,194)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:12.47,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz28.3\fs15\pos(234,239)}STOMP
