Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:13.30,main,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2C35CF&\3c&H353A67&\shad0\frz-19.03\fs15\pos(438,191)}STOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.02,overlap,MIMI,0,0,0,,I can't believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:10.15,top,MIMI,0,0,0,,His people need his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:16.66,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Let's hear everything \Nthey have to say first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.48,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,So you attacked a noble's carriage \Nso you'd be arrested
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:26.36,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,and taken to the royal castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:31.78,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Yes. We thought we'd be able to \Nspeak to the head of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:38.62,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We're sorry, but we had no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:44.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Why is everyone in this kingdom \Nso self-sacrificing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:46.08,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:50.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:54.97,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I don't know if this'll help right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:59.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,but go to the royal castle and show \Nthis to the soldiers at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:07.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If all goes well, the crown prince's aide \NRaimondo, will help you... probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:11.22,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,He works quickly, and he's a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:13.65,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Though he can be disagreeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:16.83,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Did you say something, milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:20.24,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,You know the crown prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.18,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.49,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Thank you, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.81,main,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:30.19,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,How can we thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:34.01,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Just don't do anything \Nreckless like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.40,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:38.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,There are good people in the world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:44.90,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We're proud to say \Nthat kind girl's from our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:49.19,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,We'll do our best \Nto get them to look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:52.00,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I hope it goes well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:58.74,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Sounds like more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:01.83,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Seriously? What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.41,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,It came from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.91,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:08.84,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,What a haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:12.17,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Carriages headed to the capital \Nare packed with nice stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.32,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,We got lucky with this one, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:15.78,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.09,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,This is nice meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.43,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,Someone carry this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:21.88,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Transporting nobles' goods without guards
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:26.14,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,is asking to be robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:29.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Wow, they're the very picture of bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.77,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,This is no time to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:35.29,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What should I do? \NNow that I've seen them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:36.63,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.16,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:43.82,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I know. I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:45.66,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(621,151)\c&H367BF1&\3c&HC0E5F5&\shad0}FAN{\alphaFF\t6(3,64,\alpha00)}FARE!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.66,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:48.35,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:52.25,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That carriage serves nobles \Nin the capital, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:56.25,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Yes, as they just considerately explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:13:00.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Bring tools to repair \Nthe carriage from your village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:06.52,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,If they're indebted to you, that might \Nget the guards to act more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:10.56,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,But we can't reach the village \Nwithout going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:15.64,top,BOSS,0,0,0,,Take that over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:15.98,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,We can't chase off \Nthose terrifying bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.94,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,We'll handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:29.95,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:42.01,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I hope Mimi reached \Nthe Kingdom of Muro safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:44.51,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:49.06,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,I reminded Lady Maria to avoid \Nsticking her nose in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:55.83,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:57.25,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:10.02,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Will they be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.72,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Why is she going with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.01,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,It sounded like only \Nthe strongmen would be fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:22.39,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Here's the plan, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:26.04,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Macchio and I will surround \Nthe carriage and talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:30.18,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,If they don't listen, we'll take \Nthem down one by one. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:32.14,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:34.40,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Please hide here, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:37.00,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.06,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,A lady fighting in a dress \Nwould draw too much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:44.86,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Weren't you told to stay out of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:47.49,flashback,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Under no circumstances!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:52.50,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Aw, fine. I'll watch for anyone \Nwho might try to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.47,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:56.12,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Let's go, Goffredo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:14:58.08,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.23,0:15:06.84,main,HENCHMAN 1,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.68,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Stop what you're doing, or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:16.52,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,We'll hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:19.65,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,They're terrible negotiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:25.36,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like \Nthey'll be overpowered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:29.87,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,Wait, are they just \Ntesting their abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:37.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Just watching is no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:43.92,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&HEFA94F&\3c&HAF6C28&\shad0\move(410,55,400,55)}SNEAK...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.59,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,30!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.69,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:06.51,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Don't worry? They let one get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:11.08,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Hey, I found one over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:15.45,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HDCA28C&\3c&H542D2F&\shad0d}DRAG DRAG
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:15.45,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,Milady! We told you to stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.33,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:21.49,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:23.88,sign_Arial,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H443AD2&\3c&HC5DDFA&\shad0\move(310,55,310,53)\frz21.54}TAP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:30.73,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That's a weak point known \Nas Benkei's weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:33.16,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Long ago, a giant man named Benkei
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:36.02,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,had his entire body shot \Nfull of arrows, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:39.94,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense! \NWhere did the arrows come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.28,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,You fell for it, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:50.49,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,I pretended to be unconscious \Nso you'd let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:55.33,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,If you don't want the girl \Nto get hurt, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.46,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,Now you can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:03.53,main,BOSS,0,0,0,,I'm going to take my time tormenting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:05.75,main,HENCHMAN,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.27,main,CARLO,0,0,0,,Milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:08.76,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:14.76,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,All scoundrels think the same, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:23.65,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,38!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:51.90,main,OFFICER 1,0,0,0,,Th-They're monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:53.65,main,OFFICER 2,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:07.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,What wimps. \NPrince Renato wasn't blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:09.90,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:13.68,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,You used your 38 on Prince Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:16.38,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Was he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:24.29,main,RAIMONDO,0,0,0,,Shall I get you a coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.36,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:34.01,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,In the East, they say sneezes are \Ncaused by people speaking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:39.62,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Perhaps Mimi is telling someone about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:49.69,main,MERCHANT,0,0,0,,You saved me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:53.95,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,That was almost a disaster. \NYou should hire guards next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:57.96,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,We reattached your wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:01.13,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,If you drive slowly, you can \Nmake it to the nearby village
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:03.25,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,and get proper repairs done there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.68,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I believe it's called Navarro Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:10.13,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The villagers there are \Nfamous for their kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:21.14,main,MERCHANT,0,0,0,,I don't know how to \Nthank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:23.63,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Have a pleasant trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:27.15,main,MERCHANT,0,0,0,,Wait. What are your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:32.40,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Our names aren't worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:43.45,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,It's so pretty. Navarro Village \Nis around there, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:46.20,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Yes. We're almost at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:50.64,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I wonder if those villagers have \Nalready left for the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.91,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I hope it goes well for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:56.83,main,MACCHIO,0,0,0,,You really haven't changed, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:58.74,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:01.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.37,0:20:19.66,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'm finally back in Muro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:35.27,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Could you stop the carriage \Nonce we're inside the gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:38.42,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I'd like to walk around \Nsince it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.58,main,GOFFREDO,0,0,0,,Yes, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:13.62,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'm so used to Aida's mansion \Nthat this place feels unfamiliar
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:16.26,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,even though I grew up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:23.22,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,This smell brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:27.03,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,It's like being wrapped up \Nin a warm blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:38.65,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:42.13,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:44.49,flashback,MIMI,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:53.80,italics,MIMI/ID,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:09.01,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Translation: Sho Stifler\NTiming: Mariana Martinez
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:13.39,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Editing: Alicia Ashby\NQuality Control: Ashley Barboza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.39,0:22:17.73,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Final Quality Control: Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:28.66,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I have four older sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:31.72,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,You bet they all listen to me \Nsince I'm a skilled martial artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:33.22,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,Well, you'd be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:32.85,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2F31CE&\3c&H281986&\shad0d}WHACK WHACK {\c&H4DEDFE&\3c&H30A0C1&}THUD THUD POW
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:35.98,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,My sisters are scary when \Nthey're mad, especially...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:39.16,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I spoke my mind again, but \NI stopped myself in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.94,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.94,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0\fscx88}How the {\c&H8A74F6&}One {\c&H080600&}That Got Away Fought With Her {\c&HD29E5C&}Father
